<title>SWITZERLAND: Ares-Serono 9-month net up 55 pct.</title>
<headline>Ares-Serono 9-month net up 55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			31.940	    vs 20.606</p>
<p> Net sales			562.775	   vs 502.727</p>
<p> Operating income	     65.246	    vs 42.869</p>
<p>Pre-tax oper income</p>
<p>  before minority interests 45.835	    vs 35.489</p>
<p> R&amp;D spending		   105.046	   vs 103.500</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Geneva-based international pharmaceutical company is Ares-Serono SA. Ares-Serono also reported results for the third quarter:</p>
<p>July 1-September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				    (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net income	     11.331	    vs 8.502</p>
<p> Net sales			186.894	   vs 175.905</p>
<p> Operating income	     19.586	    vs 17.325</p>
<p>Pre-tax oper income</p>
<p>  before minority interests 16.133	    vs 13.599</p>
<p> R&amp;D spending		   37.865	    vs 37.486</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
